_vrf_PLAT342_3t_pbi_1_0m_WinGX_5
;
PROBLEM: Low Bond Precision on  C-C Bonds ...............    0.04923 Ang.  
RESPONSE: Bond precision is low due to large libration for organic fragments, 
modulation and twinning. See refinement details section for details. 
;
_vrf_PLAT987_3t_pbi_1_0m_WinGX_5
;
PROBLEM: The Flack x is >> 0 -  Do a BASF/TWIN Refinement     Please Check 
RESPONSE: Data are based on an HKLF 5 type refinement with unmerged data 
incompatible with a BASF/TWIN refinement in Shelxl. See refinement details 
section for details.
;

